      "block": "**Mathematical generality through continuation, 8 October 2026.** [The checked potentialist investigation](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/ROOT-MATHEMATICAL-POTENTIAL-INTEGRATION.md) adds a precise alternative interpretation of collective quantification: ordinary relational first-order truth agrees with future-stage truth under stable meanings and continued access to every target object. Its natural-number instance has only finite stages. The 22 new Lean theorems / 45 audits include a fork where every object is initially reachable but nested quantification fails. The root's unresolved explanatory transition is now the warrant for the full continuation range and classical generality; supplying a frame neither justifies that range nor refutes a foundation using primitive modalities. This advances the authorized mathematical branch without replacing the normative priority or proving universal mathematical constitution.\n\n",
