    {
      "path": "theories/shengsheng-buxi-generative-existence/unified-2026-10-05/MATHEMATICAL-ROOT-FRONTIER.md",
      "before_sha256": "3bd2edc7a0fb6c031c92e0b725a3d8d7342e770facfd0c6470d58cd233d2b455",
      "after_sha256": "be529efdaabb8d0c7b6b8f85e86c39a4dfb15f824ead7d23d5ee4366981a055c",
      "block": "## Potential continuation and classical first-order truth\n\n**Checked 8 October 2026.** The [integrated continuation](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/ROOT-MATHEMATICAL-POTENTIAL-INTEGRATION.md) tests a different route after collective induction: mathematical quantifiers can concern later availability rather than one stage already containing every object. The [formal package](../../../experiments/integrated-correction/general-framework/generative-basis/mathematical-abstraction/constitution/potential/README.md) passes **22 new Lean theorems / 45 declaration audits**.\n\nThe declared language has equality, finite-arity relation symbols, negation, conjunction and nested first-order quantifiers. Existentials seek an available witness at a later stage; universals inspect every accessible stage and every available object there. With stable atomic meanings, growing domains and future access to every target object from **every** stage, this interpretation agrees with ambient truth. In the checked natural-number-prefix instance every stage is finite and none full. Current-stage-only quantification does not give that agreement.\n\nThe exact coverage converse tests every ambient unary predicate, not necessity for truth agreement in an arbitrary fixed signature. A three-stage Boolean fork provides a checked boundary: both values are initially reachable, yet the translated sentence “every value has a different value” fails already at the start because a branch loses the other witness. Mere initial reachability therefore does not meet the contract.\n\nThe positive argument gives unlisted finite continuation a rationale in a constructor's common meaning. The independent review accepts that as a substantive interpretation while retaining the stronger warrant question. The proof supplies the ambient structure and range of stages; it does not derive unrestricted modal entitlement or classical whole-range truth from the root. This is also not a proof that potentialism must accept a completed-frame ontology. [The primary-source comparison](../../../_process/research/2026-10-05-generative-foundation-review/root-foundation/ROOT-MATHEMATICAL-POTENTIAL-SOURCES.md) identifies the established precedent and the philosophical alternatives.\n\n**Revised next connection:** justify the modal commitments from independently warranted formation relationships while preserving the intended mathematical content. Another recoding with the same supplied range would not suffice. Function-language transport, full higher-order admission, foundation-wide coverage and exclusive constitutive priority each retain their own obligations. The successful semantic reconstruction does not settle them.\n\n",
      "block_sha256": "729fb2fce92d0d36db7a7fb5289283623baad511086d5aedd81a465bd94453ee",
      "preserved_prior_bytes_at_write": true
    },
    {
      "path": "sources/15-codex-theory-conversations/2026-10-07-mathematical-admission-and-coverage.md",
